<title>POLAND: PETROBANK APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 1.32 MLN.</title>
<headline>PETROBANK APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 1.32 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  1.32 vs    0.46</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    2.32 vs    0.77</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  5.54 vs    2.83</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 8.21 vs    5.48</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL				     1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  6.21 vs    2.65</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   10.85 vs    4.47</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 22.98 vs    9.06</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	32.39 vs   20.91</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Petrobank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
